{"video_id": "f2tWBYcouFw", "segment_index": 4, "start_seconds": 11.5600004196167, "end_seconds": 16.239999771118164, "text": "Los principiantes apenas recordaban 4 o 5, los grandes maestros hasta 20.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "f2tWBYcouFw", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 16.239999771118164, "end_seconds": 17.399999618530273, "text": "Pero acá viene el inesperado.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "f2tWBYcouFw", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 17.399999618530273, "end_seconds": 21.15999984741211, "text": "Cuando les mostraban tableros con piezas al azar, sin sentido ajedrecístico, los grandes", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "f2tWBYcouFw", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 21.15999984741211, "end_seconds": 24.1200008392334, "text": "maestros no eran ni un poco mejores que los novatos.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "f2tWBYcouFw", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 24.1200008392334, "end_seconds": 25.1200008392334, "text": "La conclusión?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "f2tWBYcouFw", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 25.1200008392334, "end_seconds": 27.399999618530273, "text": "No tienen supermemoria, tienen memoria con sentido.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "f2tWBYcouFw", "segment_index": 10, "start_seconds": 27.399999618530273, "end_seconds": 31.8799991607666, "text": "No ven piezas, ven historias, estrategias, patrones, y eso es lo que sorprende de la", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "f2tWBYcouFw", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 31.8799991607666, "end_seconds": 32.880001068115234, "text": "intuición.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "f2tWBYcouFw", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 32.880001068115234, "end_seconds": 34.84000015258789, "text": "Un gran ejemplo es el genial ajedrecista Magnus Carlsen.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "f2tWBYcouFw", "segment_index": 13, "start_seconds": 34.84000015258789, "end_seconds": 37.959999084472656, "text": "Cuando en una entrevista le preguntaron cómo decide qué jugada realizar, respondió que", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
